{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 44,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 445.319,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.994,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they did stop and withdrew a pace from them.",
      "verse": "44:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 4.174,
      "end": 6.45,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Moroni said unto Zerahemnah:",
      "verse": "44:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 6.63,
      "end": 8.163,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, Zerahemnah,",
      "verse": "44:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 8.343,
      "end": 10.851,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we do not desire to be men of blood.",
      "verse": "44:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 11.031,
      "end": 13.121,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Ye know that ye are in our hands,",
      "verse": "44:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 13.301,
      "end": 15.391,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yet we do not desire to slay you.",
      "verse": "44:1",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 16.071,
      "end": 19.415,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, we have not come out to battle against you",
      "verse": "44:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 19.595,
      "end": 22.242,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we might shed your blood for power;",
      "verse": "44:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 22.422,
      "end": 26.509,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither do we desire to bring any one to the yoke of bondage.",
      "verse": "44:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 26.689,
      "end": 30.311,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But this is the very cause for which ye have come against us;",
      "verse": "44:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 30.491,
      "end": 33.881,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and ye are angry with us because of our religion.",
      "verse": "44:2",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 34.561,
      "end": 37.301,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But now, ye behold that the Lord is with us;",
      "verse": "44:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 37.481,
      "end": 40.546,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye behold that he has delivered you into our hands.",
      "verse": "44:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 40.726,
      "end": 48.064,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I would that ye should understand that this is done unto us because of our religion and our faith in Christ.",
      "verse": "44:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 48.244,
      "end": 51.541,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now ye see that ye cannot destroy this our faith.",
      "verse": "44:3",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 52.221,
      "end": 54.915,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now ye see that this is the true faith of God;",
      "verse": "44:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 55.095,
      "end": 57.417,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, ye see that God will support,",
      "verse": "44:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 57.597,
      "end": 58.619,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and keep,",
      "verse": "44:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 58.799,
      "end": 60.239,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and preserve us,",
      "verse": "44:4",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 60.419,
      "end": 62.973,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "so long as we are faithful unto him,",
      "verse": "44:4",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 63.153,
      "end": 64.918,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and unto our faith,",
      "verse": "44:4",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 65.098,
      "end": 66.584,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and our religion;",
      "verse": "44:4",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 66.764,
      "end": 70.526,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and never will the Lord suffer that we shall be destroyed",
      "verse": "44:4",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 70.706,
      "end": 74.375,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except we should fall into transgression and deny our faith.",
      "verse": "44:4",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 75.055,
      "end": 79.281,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, Zerahemnah, I command you, in the name of that all-powerful God,",
      "verse": "44:5",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 79.461,
      "end": 81.411,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who has strengthened our arms",
      "verse": "44:5",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 81.591,
      "end": 85.91,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we have gained power over you, by our faith, by our religion,",
      "verse": "44:5",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 86.09,
      "end": 89.527,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and by our rites of worship, and by our church,",
      "verse": "44:5",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 89.707,
      "end": 93.747,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and by the sacred support which we owe to our wives and our children,",
      "verse": "44:5",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 93.927,
      "end": 97.921,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "by that liberty which binds us to our lands and our country;",
      "verse": "44:5",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 98.101,
      "end": 104.603,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and also by the maintenance of the sacred word of God, to which we owe all our happiness;",
      "verse": "44:5",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 104.783,
      "end": 107.198,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and by all that is most dear unto us\u2014",
      "verse": "44:5",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 107.878,
      "end": 109.457,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and this is not all;",
      "verse": "44:6",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 109.637,
      "end": 115.86,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I command you by all the desires which ye have for life, that ye deliver up your weapons of war unto us,",
      "verse": "44:6",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 116.04,
      "end": 118.408,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we will seek not your blood,",
      "verse": "44:6",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 118.588,
      "end": 121.792,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but we will spare your lives, if ye will go your way",
      "verse": "44:6",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 121.972,
      "end": 124.34,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and come not again to war against us.",
      "verse": "44:6",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 125.02,
      "end": 128.503,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, if ye do not this, behold, ye are in our hands,",
      "verse": "44:7",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 128.683,
      "end": 132.073,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I will command my men that they shall fall upon you,",
      "verse": "44:7",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 132.253,
      "end": 135.132,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and inflict the wounds of death in your bodies,",
      "verse": "44:7",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 135.312,
      "end": 137.17,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may become extinct;",
      "verse": "44:7",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 137.35,
      "end": 140.647,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and then we will see who shall have power over this people;",
      "verse": "44:7",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 140.827,
      "end": 144.078,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, we will see who shall be brought into bondage.",
      "verse": "44:7",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 144.758,
      "end": 148.891,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that when Zerahemnah had heard these sayings",
      "verse": "44:8",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 149.071,
      "end": 150.418,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he came forth",
      "verse": "44:8",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 150.598,
      "end": 156.031,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and delivered up his sword and his cimeter, and his bow into the hands of Moroni,",
      "verse": "44:8",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 156.211,
      "end": 157.79,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and said unto him:",
      "verse": "44:8",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 157.97,
      "end": 160.478,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, here are our weapons of war;",
      "verse": "44:8",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 160.658,
      "end": 162.934,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we will deliver them up unto you,",
      "verse": "44:8",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 163.114,
      "end": 166.504,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but we will not suffer ourselves to take an oath unto you,",
      "verse": "44:8",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 166.684,
      "end": 170.539,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which we know that we shall break, and also our children;",
      "verse": "44:8",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 170.719,
      "end": 172.623,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but take our weapons of war,",
      "verse": "44:8",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 172.803,
      "end": 175.961,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and suffer that we may depart into the wilderness;",
      "verse": "44:8",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 176.141,
      "end": 178.602,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "otherwise we will retain our swords,",
      "verse": "44:8",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 178.782,
      "end": 180.965,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we will perish or conquer.",
      "verse": "44:8",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 181.645,
      "end": 183.688,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, we are not of your faith;",
      "verse": "44:9",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 183.868,
      "end": 188.744,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we do not believe that it is God that has delivered us into your hands;",
      "verse": "44:9",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 188.924,
      "end": 193.382,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but we believe that it is your cunning that has preserved you from our swords.",
      "verse": "44:9",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 193.562,
      "end": 198.67,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, it is your breastplates and your shields that have preserved you.",
      "verse": "44:9",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 199.35,
      "end": 202.972,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now when Zerahemnah had made an end of speaking these words,",
      "verse": "44:10",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 203.152,
      "end": 206.171,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Moroni returned the sword and the weapons of war,",
      "verse": "44:10",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 206.351,
      "end": 209.37,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which he had received, unto Zerahemnah, saying:",
      "verse": "44:10",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 209.55,
      "end": 211.779,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, we will end the conflict.",
      "verse": "44:10",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 212.459,
      "end": 215.803,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now I cannot recall the words which I have spoken,",
      "verse": "44:11",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 215.983,
      "end": 220.72,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore as the Lord liveth, ye shall not depart except ye depart with an oath",
      "verse": "44:11",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 220.9,
      "end": 224.244,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye will not return again against us to war.",
      "verse": "44:11",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 224.424,
      "end": 226.328,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now as ye are in our hands",
      "verse": "44:11",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 226.508,
      "end": 229.016,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we will spill your blood upon the ground,",
      "verse": "44:11",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 229.196,
      "end": 232.725,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or ye shall submit to the conditions which I have proposed.",
      "verse": "44:11",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 233.405,
      "end": 235.913,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now when Moroni had said these words,",
      "verse": "44:12",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 236.093,
      "end": 238.09,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Zerahemnah retained his sword,",
      "verse": "44:12",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 238.27,
      "end": 240.267,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he was angry with Moroni,",
      "verse": "44:12",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 240.447,
      "end": 242.119,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he rushed forward",
      "verse": "44:12",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 242.299,
      "end": 244.342,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he might slay Moroni;",
      "verse": "44:12",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 244.522,
      "end": 246.194,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but as he raised his sword,",
      "verse": "44:12",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 246.374,
      "end": 249.996,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, one of Moroni's soldiers smote it even to the earth,",
      "verse": "44:12",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 250.176,
      "end": 253.473,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it broke by the hilt; and he also smote Zerahemnah",
      "verse": "44:12",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 253.653,
      "end": 256.904,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he took off his scalp and it fell to the earth.",
      "verse": "44:12",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 257.084,
      "end": 261.914,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Zerahemnah withdrew from before them into the midst of his soldiers.",
      "verse": "44:12",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 262.594,
      "end": 265.659,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the soldier who stood by,",
      "verse": "44:13",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 265.839,
      "end": 268.207,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who smote off the scalp of Zerahemnah,",
      "verse": "44:13",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 268.387,
      "end": 271.731,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "took up the scalp from off the ground by the hair,",
      "verse": "44:13",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 271.911,
      "end": 274.372,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and laid it upon the point of his sword,",
      "verse": "44:13",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 274.552,
      "end": 279.335,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and stretched it forth unto them, saying unto them with a loud voice:",
      "verse": "44:13",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 280.015,
      "end": 284.891,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Even as this scalp has fallen to the earth, which is the scalp of your chief,",
      "verse": "44:14",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 285.071,
      "end": 287.393,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "so shall ye fall to the earth",
      "verse": "44:14",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 287.573,
      "end": 290.684,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except ye will deliver up your weapons of war",
      "verse": "44:14",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 290.864,
      "end": 293.511,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and depart with a covenant of peace.",
      "verse": "44:14",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 294.191,
      "end": 297.349,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now there were many, when they heard these words",
      "verse": "44:15",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 297.529,
      "end": 300.315,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and saw the scalp which was upon the sword,",
      "verse": "44:15",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 300.495,
      "end": 302.353,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that were struck with fear;",
      "verse": "44:15",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 302.533,
      "end": 304.205,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and many came forth",
      "verse": "44:15",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 304.385,
      "end": 307.589,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and threw down their weapons of war at the feet of Moroni,",
      "verse": "44:15",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 307.769,
      "end": 310.091,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and entered into a covenant of peace.",
      "verse": "44:15",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 310.271,
      "end": 312.825,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And as many as entered into a covenant",
      "verse": "44:15",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 313.005,
      "end": 315.931,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they suffered to depart into the wilderness.",
      "verse": "44:15",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 316.611,
      "end": 320.373,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now it came to pass that Zerahemnah was exceedingly wroth,",
      "verse": "44:16",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 320.553,
      "end": 327.705,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he did stir up the remainder of his soldiers to anger, to contend more powerfully against the Nephites.",
      "verse": "44:16",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 328.385,
      "end": 332.843,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now Moroni was angry, because of the stubbornness of the Lamanites;",
      "verse": "44:17",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 333.023,
      "end": 337.667,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore he commanded his people that they should fall upon them and slay them.",
      "verse": "44:17",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 337.847,
      "end": 340.912,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they began to slay them;",
      "verse": "44:17",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 341.092,
      "end": 347.222,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and the Lamanites did contend with their swords and their might.",
      "verse": "44:17",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 347.902,
      "end": 352.592,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, their naked skins and their bare heads were exposed",
      "verse": "44:18",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 352.772,
      "end": 355.233,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to the sharp swords of the Nephites;",
      "verse": "44:18",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 355.413,
      "end": 357.224,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, behold they were pierced",
      "verse": "44:18",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 357.404,
      "end": 358.611,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and smitten,",
      "verse": "44:18",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 358.791,
      "end": 363.203,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and did fall exceedingly fast before the swords of the Nephites;",
      "verse": "44:18",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 363.383,
      "end": 365.519,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they began to be swept down,",
      "verse": "44:18",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 365.699,
      "end": 368.671,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even as the soldier of Moroni had prophesied.",
      "verse": "44:18",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 369.351,
      "end": 373.484,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now Zerahemnah, when he saw that they were all about to be destroyed,",
      "verse": "44:19",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 373.664,
      "end": 375.893,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "cried mightily unto Moroni,",
      "verse": "44:19",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 376.073,
      "end": 379.881,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "promising that he would covenant and also his people with them,",
      "verse": "44:19",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 380.061,
      "end": 383.126,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if they would spare the remainder of their lives,",
      "verse": "44:19",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 383.306,
      "end": 387.114,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they never would come to war again against them.",
      "verse": "44:19",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 387.794,
      "end": 394.342,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Moroni caused that the work of death should cease again among the people.",
      "verse": "44:20",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 394.522,
      "end": 397.726,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he took the weapons of war from the Lamanites;",
      "verse": "44:20",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 397.906,
      "end": 401.993,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and after they had entered into a covenant with him of peace",
      "verse": "44:20",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 402.173,
      "end": 405.145,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they were suffered to depart into the wilderness.",
      "verse": "44:20",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 405.825,
      "end": 411.026,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the number of their dead was not numbered because of the greatness of the number;",
      "verse": "44:21",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 411.206,
      "end": 414.271,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, the number of their dead was exceedingly great,",
      "verse": "44:21",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 414.451,
      "end": 417.237,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "both on the Nephites and on the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "44:21",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 417.917,
      "end": 422.747,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they did cast their dead into the waters of Sidon,",
      "verse": "44:22",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 422.927,
      "end": 426.782,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they have gone forth and are buried in the depths of the sea.",
      "verse": "44:22",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 427.462,
      "end": 431.038,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the armies of the Nephites, or of Moroni, returned",
      "verse": "44:23",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 431.218,
      "end": 433.633,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and came to their houses and their lands.",
      "verse": "44:23",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 434.313,
      "end": 439.329,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus ended the eighteenth year of the reign of the judges over the people of Nephi.",
      "verse": "44:24",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 439.509,
      "end": 441.924,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus ended the record of Alma,",
      "verse": "44:24",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 442.104,
      "end": 444.658,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was written upon the plates of Nephi.",
      "verse": "44:24",
      "lineIndex": 130
    }
  ]
}